  "description": "The Batch 16” Kids Bike is the perfect next step for young riders who are gaining confidence on two wheels. With a lightweight and durable 6061 aluminum frame, this bike is easy to maneuver, making every ride smooth and fun. The single-speed design keeps things simple, while the rear coaster brake allows kids to stop just by pedaling backward—no hand brakes to master just yet.\nThis bike is made to grow with your child, featuring an adjustable padded seat and BMX-style handlebars for a comfortable fit over time. The sturdy aluminum wheels and street-style tires ensure a stable and enjoyable ride, whether on the driveway, sidewalk, or park paths. Plus, with bold color choices like Night Emerald and Solar Orange, your little one can ride in style. Designed to be training-wheel compatible, the Batch 16” Kids Bike is the perfect companion for learning, growing, and having fun.",
